<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Unibanco Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Unibanco Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private bank Unibanco sent the following statement to the local stock exchanges on its first quarter results.</p>
<p>			     Q1 1997		 Q1 1996</p>
<p>    Net share	    0.00080 reais	 0.00130 reais</p>
<p>    Net profit	   75.805 million	    61.819 million</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
